# One public address: Netlify's default host for this site answers with a
# 301 to vanitygrinder.com, path and query kept. The full-URL `from` matches
# that exact host only, so vanitygrinder.com, deploy previews and branch or
# unique deploys (deploy-preview-N--vanitygrinder.netlify.app,
# <hash>--vanitygrinder.netlify.app) are untouched. `!` forces the redirect
# where a file exists. Keep these first: Netlify reads this file before any
# rule in netlify.toml and applies the first rule that matches. Functions
# with a path (/api/*) run before redirects and still answer on that host.
https://vanitygrinder.netlify.app/*  https://vanitygrinder.com/:splat  301!
http://vanitygrinder.netlify.app/*   https://vanitygrinder.com/:splat  301!
